1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:02,630
Meet ROVEXY.

2
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:08,590
The work app for collection agencies and their field teams.

3
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:11,130
Calls, visits and payments, all on record.

4
00:00:12,130 --> 00:00:15,040
Each day starts with prioritised cases.

5
00:00:14,790 --> 00:00:17,970
Dues, follow-ups and progress, at a glance.

6
00:00:18,970 --> 00:00:22,120
Open a case to call the customer, set a callback,

7
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:24,250
record a payment, or get directions.

8
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:27,950
Calls go out from the employee's own phone.

9
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:31,030
The recording and the call outcome are saved together.

10
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:34,850
Collect payments on the spot, with the mode,

11
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:36,430
