13
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:41,580
Customers near me shows who to visit next.

14
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:44,130
Navigate there, and check in at the address.

15
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:48,390
Supervisors can message, call over the internet,

16
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:49,960
or ask to see the screen,

17
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:51,910
only when the employee accepts.

18
00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:54,610
Transparent by design.

19
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:56,050
Built for collections.

20
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:58,620
Connected to your office, in real time.

21
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:00,350
ROVEXY.

22
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:02,120
Your workforce, in motion.
